      "message": "Rather than recomputing the same logic as `conversionSupported`, I think this would be cleaner if we added a method on `SkCodec` to retrieve the format:\n\n  SkCodec.h\n  class SkCodec {\n     ...\n   protected:\n       XformFormat getXformFormat() const { return fXformFormat; }\n     ...\n   };\n \nThen this can just be:\n \n   switch (this-\u003egetXformFormat()) {\n     case skcms_PixelFormat_RGBA_1010102:\n       swizzlerDstInfo \u003d swizzlerDstInfo.makeColorType(kRGBA_1010102_SkColorType);\n     case :\n       swizzlerDstInfo \u003d swizzlerDstInfo.makeColorType(kRGBA_8888_SkColorType);\n     default:\n       SkASSERT(false);\n   }",
